{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Prerequisite: Wisdom 17 or higher\n\nYour eye is adapted to constantly seeking for weakness, trying to find the right spot to deliver a mortal shot. You gain the following benefits:\n\n- Increase your Wisdom score by 1, to a maximum of 20.\n\n- While wielding a ranged weapon, you can sharpen your gaze with superhuman speed and synchronicity to hit the right spot. You use your action, making one single ranged attack with advantage, and if it hits, it counts as critical, which adds the damage modifier of the Ability Score used for the attack for every attack you would be able to make with the Attack action. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus, and you can\u0027t use it again until you finish a long rest.","level":1}],"id":"Customd83ab8ed-01fa-4090-80c1-582c46726691","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Deadeye [SM] [NPHB]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}